  "content": "<p>Wind's Spellbooks 為鐵魔法與法術書模組引入了全新的「風」系學派</p><hr><h2>特色內容：</h2><ul>\n<li>7 個全新可升級法術</li>\n<li>1 套全新巫師護甲套裝</li>\n<li>1 個全新建築「風車」</li>\n<li>1 種全新法師「風系法師」</li>\n<li>1 把全新法杖與法術書</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4c32775e1dff756dc78bbe98f49236164d2cf829.png\" alt=\"探索全新的風系學派\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f079b3d71b71bce28b6d50586fd0c1e4886597a1.jpeg\" alt=\"探索全新建築\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2dd7abf5be7c74aa6f369b22465018b076c3cf10.jpeg\" alt=\"遭遇風系法師\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/855d385f8ef0faf4687df4036b4b9f648cff2e5c.jpeg\" alt=\"嘗試強大的全新法術\"></p>",
